Summary     : irc server from ftp.irc.org
Description :
ircd is the server (daemon) program for the Internet Relay Chat
Program. The ircd is a server in that its function is to "serve"
the client program irc(1) with messages and commands.
All commands and user messages are passed directly to the ircd
for processing and relaying to other ircd sites.

